%% Figure 5 — The only three cross-domain contracts
%% Used in: zh/00-front.md §4, en/00-front.md §4
sequenceDiagram
  participant D as Device
  participant M as Memory
  participant E as Execution
  Note over D,M: C1 outcome line — writer must be the supervisor, never the supervised task (INV-X1)
  D->>M: append-only audit line (artefact freshness / exit code)
  Note over E,M: C2 verdict + evidence — evidence must anchor to a production snippet (INV-E4)
  E->>M: structured verdict record {class, severity, anchor, reason}
  Note over D,E: C3 wake event — no wake without passing the zero-cost gate (INV-D4)
  D->>E: one event {raw signal, gate reason}
  Note over M,E: read path only — the experience pack shares Memory's retrieval entry (INV-M9)
  M-->>E: matched entries for pre-check (hint, never a permit)
